_html": "<p><b>Sigiriya</b> or <b>Sinhagiri</b> is an ancient rock fortress located in the northern Matale District near the town of Dambulla in the Central Province, Sri Lanka. It is a site of historical and archaeological significance that is dominated by a massive column of granite approximately 180\u00a0m (590\u00a0ft) high.</p>"}